{title: Auld Lang Syne}
{artist: Robert Burns}
{level: Easy}
{duration: 2.5}
{key: C}
{time: 3/4}
{tempo: 84}
{strum: waltz-3-4}

{start_of_grid: Verse}
| C | C7 | F | G7 |
| C | C7 | F | C |
