| C | C7 | F | G7 |
| C | C7 | F | C |
{end_of_grid}

{comment: Verse 1}
[C]Should auld acquaintance [C7]be forgot
and [F]never brought to [G7]mind?
[C]Should auld acquaintance [C7]be forgot
and [F]auld lang [C]syne?

{comment: Chorus}
For [C]auld lang syne, my [C7]dear
for [F]auld lang [G7]syne
we'll [C]tak' a cup o' [C7]kindness yet
for [F]auld lang [C]syne

{comment: Verse 2}
And [C]surely ye'll be your [C7]pint-stowp
and [F]surely I'll be [G7]mine
and [C]we'll tak' a cup o' [C7]kindness yet
for [F]auld lang [C]syne
